{"version":1,"key":"doc:project:47:715","content":{"id":715,"title":"x 的平方根","content":[{"type":"header","level":2,"tauContract":"1b84ef07e920f55d81fccc0601a84826fcd79bf3ee62a898f19b0af7592aa283","collabId":"6d7ec8a9-6f10-4a8d-8dbd-4062d9d743d5","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"题目描述"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"1c9bf441-1187-436b-adc5-d7324424bb4a","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"实现 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"int sqrt(int x)"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 函数。计算并返回 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"x"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 的平方根，其中 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"x"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 是非负整数。由于返回类型是整数，结果只保留整数的部分，小数部分将被舍去。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"690f5be3-ceea-4980-8595-a41a4513816e","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"示例 1："}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"java","uuid":"173cce30-3d54-4eb4-b118-17c9da0af715","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"a46a45cb-4302-4206-9813-96748d68e790","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"输入: 4\n输出: 2","collabId":"2da47efd-5da7-4d7b-af0e-1361830ef199","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"290d17a0-e230-49d8-bdb8-e1067f45940b","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"示例 2："}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"java","uuid":"715338c9-e04e-4b38-8a9a-20decd15879d","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"557fb1a4-23fd-4d01-939c-bca8e55c5bfa","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"输入: 8\n输出: 2","collabId":"17f7351d-16a8-47cb-aba5-9a233c9de452","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"header","level":2,"tauContract":"1b84ef07e920f55d81fccc0601a84826fcd79bf3ee62a898f19b0af7592aa283","collabId":"13538c77-e59a-43d8-bd65-ee1a31398da6","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"解题思路"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"15124b68-c5d8-409d-9277-e9023f8c09ec","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"碰到这种问题，第一个想法是从 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"1"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 开始试，直到某个整数的平方小于等于 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"x"},{"type":"formatted","text":"，并且其下一个数的平方大于 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"x"},{"type":"formatted","text":"，这个时候我们可以说找到了。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"75d2970f-329e-44e8-871a-e87f3b11e748","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"我们发现我们是在有序的空间进行查找 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"1~ x/2"},{"type":"formatted","text":"，对于有序查找问题我们使用二分查找法，时间复杂度可以降低到 "},{"type":"inline-math","tauContract":"346edd25ec1d096575893afc0b9283d5c97b9a3d922ffaebf10ce904509beedc","tex":"O(\\log n)","collabId":"fed28aa7-d21e-449d-ac9e-7173d2193d9e","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"O(\\log n)"}]},{"type":"formatted","text":"。"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"java","uuid":"09701ac5-dfbf-4dc1-b134-9b54995af33d","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"f10ea80b-1227-4ffe-adb6-6949206022a5","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"public int mySqrt(int x) {\n    int start = 0;\n    int end = x;\n    while (start < end) {\n        long mid = start + (end - start) / 2;\n        if (mid * mid <= x  && x / (mid + 1) < (mid + 1)) {\n            break;\n        } else if (mid * mid < x) {\n            start = (int)++mid;\n        } else {\n            end = (int)--mid;\n        }\n    }\n    return start + (end - start) / 2;\n}","collabId":"29217276-5cef-4a38-bf5c-2a398b365e67","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"e36a18c9-3998-4b1a-81dd-00e83f619ae3","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"上面有个地方需要注意，我们使用了 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"x / (mid + 1) < mid + 1"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 而不是 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"(mid + 1) * (mid + 1) > x"},{"type":"formatted","text":"，这是因为 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"(mid + 1) * (mid + 1)"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 的结果可能会溢出，导致不正确的判断，所以这里我们使用了 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"x / (mid + 1) < (mid + 1)"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 的形式。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"62867dfe-f0f1-4be0-98c6-47a2eff78fc9","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"除了可以使用二分搜索法，还可以使用牛顿迭代法，构建下面的方程"}]},{"type":"block-math","tauContract":"4e356b907f162ad0eb2111e676848e89bc290d4d1bc01f9238aef92a7b5f8861","tex":"f(x) = x^2 - a","collabId":"3b6c4df6-55c9-4edc-949f-240211a41aad","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"4ea4bb24-fc14-4eda-8042-02818c0c93b5","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"上面方程的解就是 "},{"type":"inline-math","tauContract":"346edd25ec1d096575893afc0b9283d5c97b9a3d922ffaebf10ce904509beedc","tex":"\\sqrt{a}","collabId":"3d5c1604-d19b-446c-80d9-53e543609871","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"\\sqrt{a}"}]},{"type":"formatted","text":"，现在我们使用牛顿迭代法求解上面的方程。牛顿迭代法的公式是"}]},{"type":"block-math","tauContract":"4e356b907f162ad0eb2111e676848e89bc290d4d1bc01f9238aef92a7b5f8861","tex":"x_{n + 1} = x_{n} - \\frac{f(x_n)}{f^{'}(x_n)}","collabId":"b5a4f8e9-4783-40c6-9228-11558d2bcc99","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"41776476-99ca-4669-9338-4dd9255468d9","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"所以迭代公式为"}]},{"type":"block-math","tauContract":"4e356b907f162ad0eb2111e676848e89bc290d4d1bc01f9238aef92a7b5f8861","tex":"x_{n + 1} = \\frac{1}{2} (x_n + \\frac{a}{x_n})","collabId":"09ea3863-ab9f-40fc-9122-4c5858dabe23","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"dedf2310-72b6-4606-91c6-580c7e39fa39","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"当迭代误差小于 "},{"type":"inline-math","tauContract":"346edd25ec1d096575893afc0b9283d5c97b9a3d922ffaebf10ce904509beedc","tex":"10^{-5}","collabId":"4a6acccc-4ade-49dd-9ec6-ed32a40f4a83","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"10^{-5}"}]},{"type":"formatted","text":"，我们就可以将迭代停止了"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"java","uuid":"4874126a-c88c-45c1-9603-c0160e68df31","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"2dbcb163-f6b8-4682-b666-d8282c07861c","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"public int mySqrt(int a) {\n    // 起始迭代点\n    double x = 0.1;\n    // 上一个迭代结果\n    double pre = 0;\n    // 当误差大于 1e-5 时，继续迭代\n    while (Math.abs(x - pre) > 1e-5) {\n        pre = x;\n        x = 0.5 * (x + a/x);\n    }\n\n    // 返回整数部分\n    return (int)x;\n}","collabId":"f1877415-2e23-46d4-88d6-94ef5188a8ab","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"43bf2b69-26fa-4ee5-b2dd-908364c5c84a","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"牛顿迭代法的收敛速度是平方收敛的，其收敛速度比二分搜索法快。"}]},{"type":"header","level":2,"tauContract":"1b84ef07e920f55d81fccc0601a84826fcd79bf3ee62a898f19b0af7592aa283","collabId":"0bd2c13b-e1aa-4aab-b228-ea96be7454f6","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"参考"}]},{"type":"bulleted-list","tauContract":"b74d37e5bfbf2503c151b31f93763a8fb42e80426564246cbb0af72201a60e8c","collabId":"0a1ae8c8-455b-46b4-9b05-c3845e3bdf00","children":[{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"2697234e-505b-416b-ac16-e6e877e72445","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"7d4f532f-37ed-490f-a8e5-2e4d68f8c319","children":[{"type":"link","url":"https://leetcode-cn.com/problems/sqrtx/","openEdit":false,"tauContract":"ebf1d56e356279ad64279a16e90d9b28280f70eac20d5071950fc0c4b5c364a6","collabId":"4f423d04-2b71-4914-9874-b77440d98e98","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"x的平方根"}]}]}]}]}],"breadcrumb":[{"label":"LeetCode","target":{"key":"doc:project:47:718","type":"doc","id":718}},{"label":"数学"},{"label":"x 的平方根","target":{"key":"doc:project:47:715","type":"doc","id":715}}],"prevPage":{"title":"用最少数量的箭引爆气球","target":{"key":"doc:project:47:723","type":"doc","id":723}},"nextPage":{"title":"字符串相乘","target":{"key":"doc:project:47:724","type":"doc","id":724}},"createTime":1729002687468,"updateTime":1744296873952,"projectId":47},"meta":{"type":"doc","publishTime":1744296873952}}